## Install

{name} is on the [Frostyard Flatpak remote](https://github.com/frostyard/flatpak-index). Add it and Flathub (for the runtime) once, for your user, then install {name} and update it with `flatpak update`:

```sh
flatpak remote-add --user --if-not-exists frostyard https://frostyard.github.io/flatpak-index/frostyard.flatpakrepo
flatpak remote-add --user --if-not-exists flathub https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo
flatpak install --user frostyard {app ID}
```

## Develop

```sh
mise install   # the pinned tools
make ci        # what CI runs
make run       # build and start the app
```

[Build from source](https://frostyard.github.io/{repo}/contributing/build/) covers the toolchain and the Flatpak build.

